title: Shuffle Leadership
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer = 0 and difficulty >= 0
on-arrival: month_activities += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 8;
card-image: img/CCF_Convention.jpg
go-to: rm_main

Changing the leadership of the party is painful, but perhaps it is necessary to adapt to changing circumstances.

Removing advisors will increase dissent from their faction of the party, while selecting advisors will increase a faction's strength.

- @rm_main: Remove advisors
- @add_advisors: Add advisors
- @remove_none: Don't change advisors.
- @easy_discard


###################### removing leaders

@rm_main
title: Remove advisors.
tags: agrarian_advisor, left_advisor, managerial_advisor, labour_advisor, neorev_advisor, party_advisor 
frequency: 1

- #remove_advisor
- @add_advisors: Add advisors

@remove_none
title: Stop changing advisors.
go-to: root
tags: remove_advisor


@remove_ufc_ss
title: Remove the UFC(SS)
view-if: ufc_advisor = 1
on-arrival: ufc_advisor = 0; agrarian_dissent += 5; n_advisors -= 1
tags: remove_advisor
go-to: rm_main

The UFC(SS) has been removed as an advisor. The Agrarian faction disapproves.

