####################### adding advisors

@add_advisors
title: Add advisors
choose-if: n_advisors < 3
unavailable-subtitle: Maximum of 3 advisors.
go-to: advisor_menu

@advisor_menu
title: Add other advisors.
tags: agrarian_advisor, left_advisor, managerial_advisor, labour_advisor, neorev_advisor, party_advisor
frequency: 1


- @agrarian: Add Agrarians
- @left: Add Leftists
- @moderate: Add Moderates
- @labour: Add Labour
- @neorev: Add Neorevisionists
- @party: Add Party advisors
- @rm_main: Remove advisors instead.
- @remove_none: Stop changing advisors.

@agrarian
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #agrarian_advisor

@moderate
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #managerial_advisor

@left
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #left_advisor

@labour
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #labour_advisor

@neorev
view-if: neorevisionism > 0 and n_advisors < 3

- #neorev_advisor

@party
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #party_advisor

#                                 Agrarians

@add_williams
title: George Hara Williams
subtitle: George Hara Williams is the serving President of the [+ ccf_ss_name +]. He is a farmers by trade and was a key figure in activating agrarian socialism across Saskatchewan.  {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - International Relations, Foreign Policy, Party Discipline ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/WilliamsHaraGeorge.jpg
view-if: williams_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: williams_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu
tags: agrarian_advisor

George Hara Williams is now an advisor.

@add_cll
title: Civic Labor League
subtitle: <img src="img/protests/regina_riot_protest.jpg" class="face-image"><span>The CLL is an alliance of Social Democrats and Communists contesting Municipal Politics.</span>{!<br><br>!}
is-card: true
card-image: img/protests/regina_riot_protest.jpg
tags: labour_advisor
view-if: cll_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and labour_resign = 0
on-arrival: cll_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; labour_strength += 5
go-to: advisor_menu

The CLL is now an advisor.

@add_ufc_ss
title: The United Farmers of Canada (Saskatchewan Section)
subtitle: <img src="img/williams_speech.jpg" class="face-image"><span>The UFC(SS) is a farmer's educational organization and one of the founders of our party.</span>{!<br><br>!}
is-card: true
card-image: img/williams_speech.jpg
tags: agrarian_advisor
view-if: ufc_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and agrarians_resign = 0
on-arrival: ufc_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

The UFC(SS) is now an advisor. 

@add_wright
title: Percy Wright
subtitle: Percy Wright is a farmers by trade and a candidate in the Melfort riding. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Agricultural Policy, Farmers Campaigning, Addressing the Economic Crisis ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/WrightPercy.jpg
view-if: wright_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and agrarians_resign = 0
on-arrival: wright_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu
tags: agrarian_advisor

Percy Wright is now an advisor.

@add_eliason
title: Frank Eliason
subtitle: Frank Eliason is secretary of the [+ ccf_ss_name +] and UFC(SS). {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Support a People's Party, Women's Rights ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/EliasonFrank.jpg
view-if: eliason_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and agrarians_resign = 0
on-arrival: eliason_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu
tags: agrarian_advisor

Frank Eliason is now an advisor.

@add_irvine
title: William Irvine
subtitle: William Irvine is a social gospeler and has affiliated with the ALP and UFA in the past. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Rally for Class Struggle, Socialist Youth, Against Toleration ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/.jpg
view-if: irvine_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and agrarians_resign = 0
on-arrival: irvine_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; agrarian_strength += 5
go-to: advisor_menu
tags: agrarian_advisor

William Irvine is now an advisor.

