card-image: img/portraits/WinchErnest.jpg
view-if: winch_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and left_split = 0
on-arrival: winch_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; true_socialist_strength += 5
go-to: advisor_menu
tags: left_advisor

Ernest Winch is now an advisor.

