#                                 labour

@add_coldwell
title: Major James Coldwell
subtitle: Major James Coldwell is a former school teacher and long-time party organizer. He was Leader of the provincial CCF affiliate in Saskatchewan, the Farmer-Labour Group, while it was official opposition. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions -  Clear the Agenda, Party Discipline, Emergency Fundraising ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/ColdwellRudolf.jpg
tags: agrarian_advisor
view-if: coldwell_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and labour_resign = 0
on-arrival: coldwell_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Major James Coldwell is now an advisor.

@add_fines
title: Clarence Fines
subtitle: Clarence Fines is a protege of Coldwell. He is a former ILP member and effective organizer. He is among the right wing of the party. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Building the Left, Cooperation with the CP(S) ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/FinesClarence.jpg
view-if: fines_advisor = 0 and fines_dead = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and labour_split = 0
on-arrival: fines_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; labour_dissent += 5
go-to: advisor_menu
tags: labour_advisor

Clarence Fines is now an advisor.

@add_rwcu
title: RWCU
subtitle: RWCU is one of the leaders of the 1919 Winnipeg General Strike. He is a founding member of the Ginger Group and the [+ ccf_ss_name +]. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Organizing Workers, Addressing the Economic Crisis ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/organizations/ReliefWorkHighway.jpg
tags: labour_advisor
view-if: rwcu_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and unions_independent = 0
on-arrival: rwcu_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; labour_dissent += 5
go-to: advisor_menu

RWCU is now an advisor.

